  <item>
    <title>125 发明咖喱牛肉粉丝汤</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69edf8cc1e94ae692130beb1</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">69edf8cc1e94ae692130beb1</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 27 Apr 2026 16:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>- 嘉宾 -：李晓蓉，独立学者</span></p><span></span><p><span>- 主播 -：海博</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>- 你会听到 -</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="144">00:02:24</a></span></strong><span> 咖喱牛肉粉丝汤在上海的日常与消逝</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="293">00:04:53</a></span></strong><span> 食材溯源：咖喱与牛肉不过百年</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="351">00:05:51</a></span></strong><span> 谁给上海带来了咖喱</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="614">00:10:14</a></span></strong><span> 咖喱的本土化消费时间线</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="726">00:12:06</a></span></strong><span> 咖喱口味的下沉与渗透</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1099">00:18:19</a> 牛肉的解禁与城市屠宰</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1481">00:24:41</a></span></strong><span> 食肉的阶层分野：上层吃肉，平民喝汤</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1693">00:28:13</a></span></strong><span> 1925年3月，咖喱牛肉粉丝最早被记录</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2110">00:35:10</a></span></strong><span> 咖喱汤的河南拉面在上海</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2562">00:42:42</a></span></strong><span> 食物的历史就是普通人的历史</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2765">00:46:05</a></span></strong><span> 一道小吃的变迁背后，是地理物产、人口流动、社会结构与城市权力的交织</span></p>]]></description>
