  <item>
    <title>124 OpenClaw、一再让渡的权利与人的位置｜串台以鹅传鹅FM</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69b02e95f3a969043880003f</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">69b02e95f3a969043880003f</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 10 Mar 2026 23:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>- 主播 -</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>海博</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>- 嘉宾 -</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>袁晓辉，腾讯研究院创新研究中心主任</span></p><span></span><p><span>王秀宁，以鹅传鹅 FM 主播</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>你会听到</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>Part1：破解焦虑：AI时代的“船票”与“窗口期”</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="139">02:19</a>：AI战场，从春节“撒钱”到超级碗广告</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="533">08:53</a>：为什么AI时代不会只有一张船票？</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1259">20:59</a>：语音、隐形、持续记忆…未来的AI入口长什么样？</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2336">38:56</a>：赫拉利的问题成真：AI时代“无用之人”去哪？</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span>Part2：人的价值：生产、分配与智能普惠</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2530">42:10</a>：如果AI让多数人“无用”，社会核心问题会变成什么？</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2912">48:32</a>：未来，会“玩”可能比会“生产”更重要</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3814">01:03:34</a>：在AI时代，我们最该保护孩子的是什么？</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span>Part3. 生态发展：安全、权限与技术的价值观</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4324">01:12:04</a>：超级入口：AI时代，能否造就一个超级入口？</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4663">01:17:43</a>：安全底线：便利之外，不可忽视的权限问题</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5285">01:28:05</a>：健康的AI生态，要“让人放心，把人放大”</span></li><span></span></ul>]]></description>
